    {
        "text": "(This woman... won't be simple to deal with.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "(These bodyguards won't be able to harm me, but she poses a threat.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Foolish outsiders...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(She's angry now.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Perhaps from her perspective, she really believes that we deceived Miss Ceylon.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But, something's not right. Just who is she...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1",
        "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You must be a pretty experienced mercenary, staying disciplined even though your Mistress is gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the crap! Since you know that our boss was... Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_020",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hmm...? Wait... A crossbow, Feline, and that name...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Where have I heard that name before...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, what is this geezer doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm a bit worried about how the Doctor is doing.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...But the Doctor is capable enough, as are the others. There shouldn't be any issue.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he senile or something? He's charging straight at us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry, stop him!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_188_helage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll have to be faster than that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hellagur"
    },
